[2025-12-28 22:03:36] {"conversation_id":"09777441-707c-4cf9-aa51-601bbed9b11d","generation_id":"c0a62ede-9bf6-4b3d-8c0d-0c0d1d5f31da","model":"composer-1","tool_name":"resolve-library-id","tool_input":"{\"libraryName\": \"cursor\"}","result_json":"{\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Available Libraries:\\n\\nEach result includes:\\n- Library ID: Context7-compatible identifier (format: /org/project)\\n- Name: Library or package name\\n- Description: Short summary\\n- Code Snippets: Number of available code examples\\n- Source Reputation: Authority indicator (High, Medium, Low, or Unknown)\\n- Benchmark Score: Quality indicator (100 is the highest score)\\n- Versions: List of versions if available. Use one of those versions if the user provides a version in their query. The format of the version is /org/project/version.\\n\\nFor best results, select libraries based on name match, source reputation, snippet coverage, benchmark score, and relevance to your use case.\\n\\n----------\\n\\n- Title: Cursor\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /getcursor/docs\\n- Description: Cursor is a code editor built for programming with AI, offering features like AI chat, code generation, and debugging.\\n- Code Snippets: 31\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n----------\\n- Title: Cursor\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /llmstxt/cursor_llms_txt\\n- Description: Cursor is an AI-powered code editor that provides intelligent code completion, agent capabilities, CLI tools, and integration with various development platforms and services.\\n- Code Snippets: 7\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n----------\\n- Title: Cursory\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /vinyzu/cursory\\n- Description: Cursory is a mouse trajectory factory that generates 100% human-realistic mouse trajectories with timings, designed to avoid fingerprinting and detection.\\n- Code Snippets: 2\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n- Benchmark Score: 55.1\\n----------\\n- Title: Kysely Cursor\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /lukewpc/kysely-cursor\\n- Description: Kysely Cursor provides cursor-based keyset pagination utilities for Kysely with support for multiple database dialects, pluggable codecs, and fast stable page navigation.\\n- Code Snippets: 38\\n- Source Reputation: Medium\\n- Benchmark Score: 79.5\\n----------\\n- Title: Cursor Tools\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /eastlondoner/cursor-tools\\n- Description: Cursor Tools empowers AI agents by providing them with an AI team and advanced skills, including browser automation, LLM integration, and testing capabilities.\\n- Code Snippets: 441\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n- Benchmark Score: 43.6\\n----------\\n- Title: Cursor Free VIP\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /yeongpin/cursor-free-vip\\n- Description: A tool for educational purposes that supports Windows, macOS, and Linux, designed to reset Cursor's configuration and offers multi-language support.\\n- Code Snippets: 12\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n- Benchmark Score: 36.5\\n----------\\n- Title: Ghost Cursor\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /xetera/ghost-cursor\\n- Description: Ghost Cursor generates realistic, human-like mouse movement data between coordinates or navigates between elements with Puppeteer to simulate natural user interaction.\\n- Code Snippets: 28\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n- Benchmark Score: 84.5\\n----------\\n- Title: Where Is My Cursor\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /luciodaou/raycast-where-is-my-cursor\\n- Description: A Raycast extension that helps locate your cursor on multi-monitor setups by dimming the screen and highlighting the cursor's position with customizable visual effects.\\n- Code Snippets: 21\\n- Source Reputation: Medium\\n- Benchmark Score: 83\\n----------\\n- Title: Cursor CLI\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /websites/cursor_cli\\n- Description: Cursor CLI allows users to interact with AI agents from the terminal for writing, reviewing, and modifying code, offering both interactive and non-interactive modes for scripting and CI pipelines.\\n- Code Snippets: 101\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n- Benchmark Score: 55.4\\n----------\\n- Title: Cursor (llmstxt)\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /llmstxt/cursor-llms-full.txt\\n- Description: Cursor provides tools for managing subscriptions, refunds, and invoices, with various pricing plans for individual and team users based on usage and features.\\n- Code Snippets: 5861\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n----------\\n- Title: Go Cursor Help\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /yuaotian/go-cursor-help\\n- Description: A tool to reset Cursor IDE's free trial by modifying machine identifiers, supporting Windows, macOS, and Linux platforms.\\n- Code Snippets: 28\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n- Benchmark Score: 42.7\\n----------\\n- Title: Cursor APIs\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /websites/cursor_api\\n- Description: Cursor APIs provide programmatic access to team data, AI-powered coding agents, analytics, and code tracking for enterprise teams and automated workflows.\\n- Code Snippets: 41\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n----------\\n- Title: Cursor Stats\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /dwtexe/cursor-stats\\n- Description: A Cursor extension that provides real-time monitoring of subscription usage, including fast requests and usage-based pricing information.\\n- Code Snippets: 2\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n----------\\n- Title: Scoot\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /mjrusso/scoot\\n- Description: Scoot is a macOS utility that provides fast, keyboard-driven control over the mouse pointer, enabling cursor teleportation and actuation through element-based or grid-based navigation.\\n- Code Snippets: 19\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n----------\\n- Title: HumanCursor\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /riflosnake/humancursor\\n- Description: HumanCursor is a Python package that simulates realistic human mouse movements for web and system automation, designed to bypass bot detection.\\n- Code Snippets: 12\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n----------\\n- Title: scraper\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /websites/docs_rs-scraper-0.23.1-scraper\\n- Description: HTML parsing and querying with CSS selectors. Scraper provides an interface to Servo’s html5ever and selectors crates, for browser-grade parsing and querying.\\n- Code Snippets: 155996\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n----------\\n- Title: Memory Bank System\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /angry-robot-deals/cursor-memory-bank-angry\\n- Description: A token-optimized, hierarchical task management system that uses Cursor 2.0 commands to guide development workflows with integrated AI Quality Rules for efficient and structured coding.\\n- Code Snippets: 304\\n- Source Reputation: Medium\\n- Benchmark Score: 83.3\\n----------\\n- Title: vim-illuminate\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /rrethy/vim-illuminate\\n- Description: A Neovim plugin for automatically highlighting other uses of the word under the cursor using either LSP, Tree-sitter, or regex matching.\\n- Code Snippets: 35\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n- Benchmark Score: 63.9\\n----------\\n- Title: Cursor AI PRD Workflow\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /nurettincoban/cursor-ai-prd-workflow\\n- Description: A collection of reusable AI prompts designed to streamline product development workflows by automating common tasks through structured documentation.\\n- Code Snippets: 5\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n----------\\n- Title: Cursor Rules CLI\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /gabimoncha/cursor-rules-cli\\n- Description: A command-line tool for managing AI-assisted guidance in projects through Cursor IDE rules with interactive setup and security scanning.\\n- Code Snippets: 36\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n- Benchmark Score: 77.6\\n----------\\n- Title: Cursor AI\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /oslook/cursor-ai-downloads\\n- Description: All Cursor AI's official download links for both the latest and older versions, making it easy for you to update, downgrade, and choose any version. 🚀\\n- Code Snippets: 213\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n----------\\n- Title: Cursor Memory Bank\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /vanzan01/cursor-memory-bank\\n- Description: A token-optimized, hierarchical task management system that integrates with Cursor custom modes for efficient development workflows.\\n- Code Snippets: 68\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n----------\\n- Title: Interactive User Feedback MCP\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /noopstudios/interactive-feedback-mcp\\n- Description: A simple MCP Server that enables a human-in-the-loop workflow for AI-assisted development tools like Cursor, allowing users to run commands, view output, and provide textual feedback directly to the AI.\\n- Code Snippets: 9\\n- Source Reputation: Medium\\n----------\\n- Title: Figma Context MCP\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /glips/figma-context-mcp\\n- Description: This server provides AI coding agents like Cursor with access to Figma design data, enabling accurate one-shot implementation of designs across various frameworks.\\n- Code Snippets: 40\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n- Benchmark Score: 65.4\\n----------\\n- Title: Scraper\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /rust-scraper/scraper\\n- Description: Scraper is a Rust library for HTML parsing and querying with CSS selectors, providing a browser-grade interface to Servo's `html5ever` and `selectors` crates.\\n- Code Snippets: 38\\n- Source Reputation: Medium\\n- Benchmark Score: 77.8\\n----------\\n- Title: vmulti-mice\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /kolyn090/vmulti-mice\\n- Description: This project provides a Python client and a custom driver for programmatically controlling a virtual mouse on Windows, enabling actions like clicking at a given position without moving the system cursor.\\n- Code Snippets: 26\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n- Benchmark Score: 56.7\\n----------\\n- Title: PHP-Scoper\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /humbug/php-scoper\\n- Description: PHP-Scoper is a tool designed to move any body of code, including its vendor dependencies, into a new and distinct namespace to prevent conflicts, especially when building PHARs that bundle their own dependencies.\\n- Code Snippets: 35\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n- Benchmark Score: 92.4\\n----------\\n- Title: Maccel\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /gnarus-g/maccel\\n- Description: Maccel is a mouse pointer acceleration driver with a CLI and TUI for easily editing curve parameters, supporting linear, natural, and synchronous acceleration functions.\\n- Code Snippets: 20\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n----------\\n- Title: Code Inspector\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /zh-lx/code-inspector\\n- Description: Click elements on a webpage to automatically open the code editor and position the cursor to the source code of the element.\\n- Code Snippets: 187\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n- Benchmark Score: 82.3\\n----------\\n- Title: Walkr\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /k13labs/walkr\\n- Description: Walkr is a Clojure library designed to simplify the process of walking and reducing Clojure data structures.\\n- Code Snippets: 2\\n- Source Reputation: Low\"}]}","duration":800.6,"hook_event_name":"afterMCPExecution","cursor_version":"2.2.36","workspace_roots":["/Users/tamar/cursor-mental-models-demo"],"user_email":"t0548453823@gmail.com"}
