sts to prevent future CI failures\"\n    ],\n    \"relatedFeatures\": [\n      \"Error Analysis\",\n      \"Test Fixes\",\n      \"CI Configuration\",\n      \"Build Debugging\"\n    ],\n    \"docs\": [\n      {\n        \"label\": \"Cursor Docs - CI/CD\",\n        \"url\": \"https://docs.cursor.com\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": \"knowledge-retriever\",\n    \"title\": \"Cursor as a Knowledge Retriever\",\n    \"shortDescription\": \"Cursor acts as a smart knowledge base that can search through your codebase, documentation, and code history to find relevant information and answer questions.\",\n    \"detailedExplanation\": [\n      \"Cursor can search across your entire codebase to find where specific functionality is implemented\",\n      \"It helps you understand how different parts of your codebase connect and interact\",\n      \"You can ask questions about your codebase and get answers based on actual code\",\n      \"It can help you discover existing patterns, utilities, and conventions in your project\",\n      \"Cursor remembers context from previous conversations and code you've worked on\"\n    ],\n    \"relatedFeatures\": [\n      \"Codebase Search\",\n      \"Documentation Lookup\",\n      \"Pattern Discovery\",\n      \"Context Memory\"\n    ],\n    \"docs\": [\n      {\n        \"label\": \"Cursor Docs - Knowledge Base\",\n        \"url\": \"https://docs.cursor.com\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n]\n","new_string":"[\n  {\n    \"id\": \"planner\",\n    \"title\": \"Cursor as a Planner\",\n    \"shortDescription\": \"Think of Cursor as a strategic planner that helps break down complex tasks into manageable steps and creates structured roadmaps for your projects.\",\n    \"detailedExplanation\": [\n      \"Cursor can analyze your project requirements and suggest a step-by-step implementation plan\",\n      \"It helps you think through edge cases and potential issues before you start coding\",\n      \"You can ask Cursor to create task breakdowns, tim