tructured coding.\\n- Code Snippets: 304\\n- Source Reputation: Medium\\n- Benchmark Score: 83.3\\n----------\\n- Title: Cursor Tools\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /eastlondoner/cursor-tools\\n- Description: Cursor Tools empowers AI agents by providing them with an AI team and advanced skills, including browser automation, LLM integration, and testing capabilities.\\n- Code Snippets: 441\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n- Benchmark Score: 43.6\\n----------\\n- Title: System Prompts and Models of AI Tools\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /x1xhlol/system-prompts-and-models-of-ai-tools\\n- Description: A comprehensive collection of system prompts, tools, and AI models from various AI applications and platforms, including Cursor, Devin, Replit Agent, and more.\\n- Code Snippets: 582\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n- Benchmark Score: 76.3\\n----------\\n- Title: Cursor Memory Bank\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /vanzan01/cursor-memory-bank\\n- Description: A token-optimized, hierarchical task management system that integrates with Cursor custom modes for efficient development workflows.\\n- Code Snippets: 68\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n----------\\n- Title: Cursor\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /getcursor/docs\\n- Description: Cursor is a code editor built for programming with AI, offering features like AI chat, code generation, and debugging.\\n- Code Snippets: 31\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n----------\\n- Title: Bouncer\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /josephsilber/bouncer\\n- Description: Bouncer is an elegant, framework-agnostic approach to managing roles and abilities for any app using Eloquent models, offering an expressive and fluent syntax.\\n- Code Snippets: 73\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n----------\\n- Title: Supabase MCP\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /supabase-community/supabase-mcp\\n- Description: Connects Supabase projects to AI assistants like Cursor and Claude using the Model Context Protocol for tasks like data management and querying.\\n- Code Snippets: 19\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n- Benchmark Score: 58.1\\n----------\\n- Title: Mind Map MCP Server\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /nerfels/mind-map\\n- Description: Mind Map MCP Server is an experimental Model Context Protocol (MCP) server that explores neuroscience-inspired approaches to software development analysis, featuring advanced query caching, associative learning, context awareness, and code analysis tools.\\n- Code Snippets: 212\\n- Source Reputation: Low\\n- Benchmark Score: 56.8\\n----------\\n- Title: MSCRS\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /biaobiao12138/mscrs-main\\n- Description: MSCRS is a framework for conversational recommender systems that utilizes multi-modal semantic graph prompt learning, including processed datasets and code for recommendation and conversation tasks.\\n- Code Snippets: 6\\n- Source Reputation: Medium\\n----------\\n- Title: Less is More: Recursive Reasoning with Tiny Networks\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /samsungsailmontreal/tinyrecursivemodels\\n- Description: A recursive reasoning approach using Tiny Recursion Model (TRM), a 7M parameter neural network, to achieve high scores on ARC-AGI tasks, emphasizing efficient reasoning with small models.\\n- Code Snippets: 27\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n- Benchmark Score: 69.9\\n----------\\n- Title: Kubectl MCP Server\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /rohitg00/kubectl-mcp-server\\n- Description: A Model Context Protocol (MCP) server for Kubernetes that enables AI assistants like Claude, Cursor, and others to interact with Kubernetes clusters through natural language.\\n- Code Snippets: 528\\n- Source Reputation: High\\n- Benchmark Score: 48.2\\n----------\\n- Title: HumanCursor\\n- Context7-compatible library ID: /riflosnake/humancursor\\n- Description: HumanCursor is a Python package that simulates realistic human mouse movements for web and system automation, designed to bypass bot detection.\\n- Code Snippets: 12\\n- Source Repu